{"strongs": "H2690", "word": "חצצר", "translit": "cha.tsar", "root": "חצר", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "sound a clarion", "definition": "[ חצצר ] verb Kt , [ חצר ] Qr , denominative from חצצרה = sound a clarion — Pi`el Participle מְחַצְּצ֯רִים 2Chr 5:13 ( Qr מְחַצְּרִים ) = players on clarions . Hiph`il Participle מַחְצְצ֯רִים ( Qr מַחְצְרִים as Hiph`il see Kö ii, 252 ) 1Chr 15:24 + 3 t. + 2Chr 5:12 Baer , ( van d. H מחצררים ); sound with clarions ׳ מח בחצצרות 1Chr 15:24 ; 2Chr 5:12 ; 2Chr 13:14 absolute sounded (sounding) 2Chr 7:6 ; 2Chr 29:28 , compare חצצרה near the end ( Kt in all to be pronounced (probably) מְחַצְצְרִים ). חֵק see חֵיק below חוק ; חֹק see below חקק .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3068')\">BDB3068</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2690')\">H2690</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3067')\">BDB3067</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3069')\">BDB3069</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>חצצר</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>, [<bdbheb>חצר</bdbheb>] <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>, denominative from <bdbheb>חצצרה</bdbheb> = <highlight>sound a clarion</highlight> — <div class=\"point\"><b>Pi`el</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מְחַצְּצ֯רִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,13)\">2Chr 5:13</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>מְחַצְּרִים</bdbheb>) = <highlight>players on clarions</highlight>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַחְצְצ֯רִים</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>מַחְצְרִים</bdbheb> as Hiph`il see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii, 252</sup></lookup>) <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,24)\">1Chr 15:24</ref> + 3